 <body style="padding:8px;margin:auto!important;z-index:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;position:relative;">
  <div style="padding-top:0.5in;z-index:2;min-height:0.4in;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;"><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p></div>
  <div class="main-content-container" style="z-index:5;position:relative;"><h2 style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:right;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Exhibit 99.1</font></h2><h2 style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:10pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;text-decoration:underline solid;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE</font></h2><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:9pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">BENCHMARK DELIVERS RECORD THIRD QUARTER REVENUE AND STRONG EARNINGS GROWTH</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-weight:bold;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">RAISES FISCAL YEAR 2026 OUTLOOK</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:center;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">TEMPE, AZ, October 28, 2026 &#x2013; Benchmark Electronics, Inc. (NYSE: BHE) today announced financial results for the third quarter ended September 30, 2026.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Third quarter 2026 results:</font></p><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Revenue of $811 million, up 19% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Diluted GAAP earnings per share of $0.47, up 21% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Diluted non-GAAP earnings per share of $0.84, up 35% year-over-year</font></div></div><div class="item-list-element-wrapper" style="margin-left:3.333%;tab-size:32px;display:flex;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;justify-content:flex-start;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:0;min-width:3.333%;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:3.447919145106397%;word-break:keep-all;display:inline-flex;justify-content:flex-start;">&#x2022;</font><div style="display:inline;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Operating cash flow of $30 million with free cash flow of $14 million</font></div></div><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:12pt;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#34;Our third quarter results reflect the continued transformation of Benchmark into a higher-performing company,&#34; said David Moezidis, Benchmark's President and CEO.</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Moezidis continued, &#34;Demand is broadening across our portfolio, bookings momentum remains healthy, and our teams continue to execute at a high level. As a result, we delivered record quarterly revenue, grew earnings at nearly twice the rate of sales, and are once again raising our outlook for the year. We now expect 2026 revenue growth of approximately 16%, further increasing our outlook beyond the $3 billion annual revenue level we established last quarter.&#34;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p><p style="tab-size:26.66px;font-size:11pt;margin-top:0;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><font style="white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:11pt;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">&#160;</font></p>
